            "review_title": "Review at Simor Garden Coffee",
            "review_text": "Simen Steinnes Garvik\nFlekkefjord, Norway5 contributions\n0\nFantastic! Superb staff!\nJul 2026 • Family\nWhat a fantastic cafe! Good and affordable drinks. The staff is absolutely fantastic!\nThe woman who works here must be the most sparkling and happy person I've ever met, will remember this lady for a long time. Coming back here next time I'm in Da Nang! 10/10!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Norwegian\nShow original\nWritten July 5, 2026",
